proposals.neighbours:
类 shares the same map, on the merge side, so this is a role pair like 待者/所待. 理 becomes 文 of 成物 (genus and species, literally). Three collisions:
- 辨 already names a 码 telling 义项 apart (TellsApart, injectivity);
- 分 names exclusive footprints (C13);
- 别 names bounded significance.
状, 象, 像, 读, 名, 码, 义项 and 符 are unchanged. The course stays unnamed (历程).

